mm</MET><ENG> [48] [44] inch</ENG> coverage and exposed fasteners.</ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
][<ITM>profile to be a<MET> 25.4 mm</MET><ENG> 1 inch</ENG> high rib at<MET> 203.2 mm</MET><ENG> 8 inches</ENG> o.c.,<MET> 1057.3 mm</MET><ENG> 41-5/8 inch</ENG> overall width with<MET> 1016 mm</MET><ENG> 40 inch</ENG> coverage 
