seams with concealed clips and fasteners.</ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
][<ITM>profile to be a<MET> [25.4] [44.5] [50.8] [63.5] mm</MET><ENG> [1] [1-3/4] [2] [2-1/2] inch</ENG> high standing seam,<MET> [304.8] [406.4] [457.2] mm</MET><ENG> [12] 
